      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Free-running counter to *read* elapsed time",
      "source_hash": 1640277157702244605,
      "context_hash": 14008482051087418887,
      "translation": "경과 시간을 *읽기* 위한 자유 실행(free-running) 카운터",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:03.472148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "TSC, HPET, ACPI PM timer",
      "source_hash": 7444525727667212112,
      "context_hash": 2496897227529228097,
      "translation": "TSC, HPET, ACPI PM 타이머",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ACPI": "ACPI",
        "TSC": "TSC",
        "timer": "타이머"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:03.472148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "**clockevent**",
      "source_hash": 12003409716782320128,
      "context_hash": 2507062550065508339,
      "translation": "**clockevent**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:03.472148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Programmable device to *generate* interrupts at a future time",
      "source_hash": 15650770527766233500,
      "context_hash": 15833961786007909308,
      "translation": "미래의 특정 시점에 인터럽트를 *발생시키는* 프로그래밍 가능한 디바이스",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "interrupts": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:35:36.746478Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "LAPIC timer, HPET, ARM generic timer",
      "source_hash": 2845713487625404397,
      "context_hash": 3354635935529771711,
      "translation": "LAPIC 타이머, HPET, ARM generic timer",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "timer": "타이머"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:03.472149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "A clocksource is polled; a clockevent fires interrupts.",
      "source_hash": 11842300278937916340,
      "context_hash": 2473336545629285175,
      "translation": "clocksource는 폴링 방식으로 읽고, clockevent는 인터럽트를 발생시킵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "clocksource": "clocksource",
        "interrupts": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:03.472149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "Both are needed: the clocksource provides nanosecond-resolution reads; the clockevent drives the scheduler tick and hrtimers.",
      "source_hash": 5297056748945750474,
      "context_hash": 13349292768585480781,
      "translation": "둘 다 필요합니다: clocksource는 나노초 해상도의 읽기를 제공하고, clockevent는 스케줄러 틱과 hrtimer를 구동합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "clocksource": "clocksource",
        "hrtimers": "hrtimer",
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:03.472149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct clocksource",
      "source_hash": 2341711294676623695,
      "context_hash": 17426680791350509104,
      "translation": "struct clocksource",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "clocksource": "clocksource"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:03.472150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Counter → nanoseconds conversion",
      "source_hash": 15962282276260740149,
      "context_hash": 3107625752755622003,
      "translation": "카운터 → 나노초 변환",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:03.472150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The `mult` and `shift` fields avoid division in the hot path:",
      "source_hash": 6314565390132618653,
      "context_hash": 12079259487932869476,
      "translation": "`mult`와 `shift` 필드는 핫 패스에서 나눗셈을 피하기 위한 것입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hot path": "핫 패스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:03.472150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "For a 3.6 GHz TSC: `mult ≈ 1165084`, `shift = 22`.",
      "source_hash": 13600976639505532643,
      "context_hash": 7913485350249287080,
      "translation": "3.6 GHz TSC의 경우: `mult ≈ 1165084`, `shift = 22`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TSC": "TSC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:03.472150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Each call to `clock_gettime` does one `rdtsc` + one multiply + one shift — no division, no lock.",
      "source_hash": 5645165418437515438,
      "context_hash": 11155385663334920133,
      "translation": "`clock_gettime`를 호출할 때마다 `rdtsc` 한 번, 곱셈 한 번, 시프트 한 번만 수행하며, 나눗셈도 락도 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:03.472150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct timekeeper",
      "source_hash": 17439830485334318824,
      "context_hash": 5564780391914558825,
